        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;  Automatic → code is NULL; selected rooms allowed. Code → code required; all rooms only.&lt;br&gt;UQ (hotel_id, normalized_code). One redemption per booking; no stacking. Room targets must belong to the same hotel.&lt;br&gt;¹ Usage counters are optional implementation support for code limits; composite keys shown are proposed.&lt;br&gt;Redemption: reserved → redeemed or released. Both modes keep history. Automatic offers have no use limits in v1. Booking JSON preserves original terms and allocations.&lt;br&gt;Crow’s foot: circle = zero; bar = one; fork = many. Context-only buyer/hotel/audit FKs are named in rows; their extra lines are omitted.&lt;br&gt;Source: docs/plan/discount-feature.md. Proposed design, not an extracted database schema." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1580" width="1680" height="170" />
        </mxCell>
